# Curse of Thirst: at the beginning of the enchanted player's upkeep it deals
# damage to that player equal to the number of Curses attached to them
# (Count$Valid Curse.AttachedTo Player.EnchantedBy). ai is enchanted by Thirst
# and Vitality, so Thirst deals 2; the Thirst on human enchants human, so it
# stays silent on ai's upkeep (ValidPlayer$ Player.EnchantedBy).
startturn ai
advance
resolvestack
